Unleash dark forces to all foes in sight that are afflicted by Soul Leech, dealing [184, 248, 298, 340, 377 (TL1-5; SP 100)] frostdusk damage to them and tearing apart their souls.

This returns up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] souls to you (one for each foe hit).

The damage increases with your Spellpower.
